{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるーむへようこそ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学校が始まって、バタバタな毎日を\n過ごしております( ◦˙ ˙◦ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんはどうお過ごしですか〜？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個別握手会がパシフィコ横浜にて\n2回行われたので、\nその時の私服を皆さんに紹介します！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"9/18\n4部"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2017/09/28/0069844/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"tops: ZARA\nskirt: Mila Owen\n(with green smoothie)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"hair: シニヨン(下の方のお団子)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"シンプルな白シャツに見えて\n実は袖に大きなフリルがついていて\nボリューミーなのがポイント！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年の秋は袖にポイントがあるのが\n流行りっていうのを聞いたことがある☺︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5部"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2017/09/28/0069844/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"tops: Another Edition\nskirt: Mila Owen"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"hair: 巻き下ろし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スカートは着まわし！\n5部ではお姉さんぽく。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ピンクのトップスはサテン地だから\n着心地も良いし、\n甘々になりすぎないからいいね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"9/24\n4部"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2017/09/28/0069844/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"tops: snidel\ndenim: Mila Owen\n(with pear smoothie)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"hair: 巻きハーフアップ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふわふわモコモコのニットトップスは\n半袖だから、秋の始まりの今に丁度いい気がする！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"トップスが女の子っぽいから\nデニムで、カジュアルダウンしたのがポイント。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5部"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2017/09/28/0069844/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"tops: Another Edition\ndenim: Mila Owen\nchoker: ZARA"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"hair: デコだし巻き下ろし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"デニムは4部と同じだけど\n全く雰囲気の違った、黒トップスにしてみました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おデコを出して、チョーカーもすると\n一気にクールになる☺︎\n色んな自分になれるのって楽しいね！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会でどんな格好をしようか...？\nどんな髪型をしようか...？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と悩む時間が楽しくて好きです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんいつも会いに来てくださって\n本当にありがとうございます！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"19thの握手会受付もだんだんと\n始まってきています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"18thより部数が増えて嬉しく思いつつも、\n少しだけ不安もあります...\n沢山の方が会いに来てくださるのを\n心からお待ちしています(> <)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2017/09/28/0069844/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＊「のぎ天2  #32」、9月29日から配信開始"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回はボードゲーム対決をしました。\n笑顔が絶えなかったな〜\n楽しかった♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＊「MARQUEE  Vol.123」10月10日発売"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずっとずーっと出たかった、\n川後の連載についに出演します！\n嬉しかった〜♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私と川後にぴったり(!?)な\n衣装やメイク、世界観なので...\n是非チェックしてみてください。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日はセブンライブ、\n明後日は個別握手会、\nどちらも名古屋です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しみにしてます〜◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"斎藤ちはる"}],"source":"archive"}